1. **This file first**, then skills.
2. If skills contradict each other (e.g., one suggests one folder structure,
   another suggests a different one) — follow this `CLAUDE.md`, not the skill.
3. Never suggest alternative state-management packages (Riverpod, Provider,
   GetX) "for variety". The stack is locked.
